WEBVTT

00:04.000 --> 00:09.210
<b>Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs</b>

00:04.000 --> 00:09.210
<b>Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs</b>

00:04.000 --> 00:09.210
<b>Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs</b>

00:04.000 --> 00:09.210
<b>Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs Meatballs</b>

00:04.170 --> 00:13.040
Meatballs, meatballs, meatballs...

00:21.750 --> 00:24.380
I'm hungry.

02:13.330 --> 02:18.080
Those meatballs must have
come from the lady he just killed.

02:30.250 --> 02:31.540
I want more.

02:38.290 --> 02:39.130
Kei-kun!

02:39.920 --> 02:41.080
Stay on your guard.

02:41.920 --> 02:46.210
This spirit is likely one of the strongest
S-Rank spirits out there.

02:46.960 --> 02:54.460
From what I can tell, his attacks consume his targets,
which in turn, makes him stronger.

02:55.540 --> 03:00.420
When he colors over your drawing in his sketchbook,

03:00.670 --> 03:06.130
the part he colored over disappears
and turns into meatballs.

03:07.170 --> 03:11.290
Then he consumes the meatballs,
making him even stronger.

03:13.460 --> 03:19.540
Once your drawing is in his book,
there's no escaping his curse.

03:21.420 --> 03:26.790
My mom is everywhere.
I'll make her into meatballs.

03:29.540 --> 03:35.330
He's already cursed the three of us,
but the dolls will hold him off for the time being.

03:36.790 --> 03:43.540
But our spirits don't have that protection.
He'll kill and absorb them in a split second.

03:44.920 --> 03:51.380
That goes for Graduates, too, which is why
we have to do something about that sketchbook.

03:51.920 --> 03:58.290
Our first step is to steal it and get rid of it
while we still have dolls protecting us.

03:59.500 --> 04:02.630
Do that, and we win.

04:03.000 --> 04:08.130
We'll be free of his curse,
and our Graduate can safely come out to play.

04:08.880 --> 04:13.210
Then we wait for them to beat him to a pulp.
Game over, we win.

04:13.630 --> 04:18.290
S-so that all sounds good,
but how are we supposed to steal it from him?

04:18.580 --> 04:20.830
Simple. We use this.

04:23.380 --> 04:24.080
Yayoi-chan?!

04:26.540 --> 04:27.880
Huh? Kei-kun?

04:27.960 --> 04:29.080
Wait, Yayoi-chan?!

05:03.920 --> 05:07.210
Yayoi-chan! We have to help her!

05:08.250 --> 05:08.880
Kei-kun?!

05:13.080 --> 05:15.210
The water's rising...

05:18.540 --> 05:20.250
I-I'm gonna drown...

05:20.380 --> 05:24.080
Eiko, take the doll and go save Yayoi-chan!

05:24.880 --> 05:26.290
B-but what about you?

05:26.380 --> 05:29.420
I'll be fine, just go before I'm a goner!

05:30.630 --> 05:32.710
Save Yayoi-chan,

05:33.920 --> 05:38.920
then, the two of you can come back for me, yeah?

05:43.670 --> 05:45.000
I'll be right back!

05:48.420 --> 05:49.630
Mom?

05:59.750 --> 06:01.130
He's attacking me!

06:04.170 --> 06:06.080
Why aren't you meatballs?

06:16.960 --> 06:18.500
I've got my secret weapon...

06:20.000 --> 06:22.500
I'll be okay!

06:32.380 --> 06:33.290
Yayoi-chan!

06:33.710 --> 06:34.420
Here!

06:39.540 --> 06:40.380
Yayoi-chan!

06:41.000 --> 06:43.540
Thanks, Eiko. That was close.

06:43.920 --> 06:45.830
I'm just glad you're okay.

06:46.580 --> 06:50.040
We'd better go help Keitaro, and fast...

06:50.420 --> 06:51.000
Yeah.

07:07.210 --> 07:09.790
What is this? A shower door?

07:10.380 --> 07:11.710
I-it's stuck!

07:29.420 --> 07:31.420
No. Stop!

07:32.210 --> 07:33.540
Get away from me!

07:44.040 --> 07:45.210
There's no blood.

07:46.080 --> 07:47.210
It's going right through her.

07:50.540 --> 07:52.460
The doll's taking the attack.

08:01.330 --> 08:02.290
You okay?

08:02.920 --> 08:04.630
I am, thanks!

08:11.500 --> 08:13.670
They went back to the boy.

08:14.460 --> 08:17.580
Seems that room and the spirits in it
were part of him all along.

08:18.330 --> 08:19.250
Now, then...

08:26.710 --> 08:30.210
Yayoi-chan, I've got an idea.

08:30.630 --> 08:33.500
But I might end up needing your help...

08:36.830 --> 08:37.750
Keitaro!

08:39.830 --> 08:40.920
Yayoi-chan!

08:42.250 --> 08:44.170
Thanks for holding out. You'll be free in a sec.

08:52.040 --> 08:53.000
Yayoi-chan!

08:53.000 --> 08:55.630
I know. I just need a little more time...

09:12.880 --> 09:13.630
I'm free!

09:23.920 --> 09:24.830
Payback time.

09:25.420 --> 09:27.710
Come at me, motherf***er.

09:28.040 --> 09:30.500
Whoa, what the hell, Yayoi-chan?!

09:30.500 --> 09:31.290
Kei-kun!

09:31.750 --> 09:32.630
Eiko!

10:05.330 --> 10:06.750
Taunting him worked.

10:07.710 --> 10:13.420
The High Priest's attacks take time to take effect,
so he won't work against him.

10:13.920 --> 10:18.330
The Martyr seems like the right choice,
but he goes easy on women and children.

10:18.960 --> 10:23.790
That leaves her as the better choice.

10:24.580 --> 10:29.460
But there's a chance she'll immediately
go after us as soon as she's released.

10:30.830 --> 10:36.790
That's why I made her take one of his attacks,
to get her to be pissed at him instead.

10:39.330 --> 10:41.000
Looks like my plan worked.

10:41.830 --> 10:44.830
The sketchbook's too soaked to curse anyone.

10:45.790 --> 10:48.500
Now, we fight back.

10:49.790 --> 10:50.960
Bedazzle us...

11:27.580 --> 11:29.920
...Otogiri Oiran, the Soul-Sucking Courtesan.

11:36.830 --> 11:41.630
I discovered her about a year ago
at a random swap meet.

11:42.830 --> 11:49.380
Apparently, whoever owns this creepy mirror
starts to age quicker.

11:49.670 --> 11:50.920
You can have it for 100 yen.

11:52.130 --> 11:55.380
She didn't look strong. Seemed like your typical ghost.

11:56.210 --> 12:00.920
But that story put me a bit on edge,
so I put her in my room for safekeeping just in case.

12:02.040 --> 12:05.960
But about a month into having her, she transformed.

12:07.250 --> 12:13.040
She consumed the spirits in my room
and channeled her grudge into a powerful curse.

12:13.630 --> 12:18.080
Her name, Otogiri, means Hypericum flowers.
In bouquets, they signify a hostile grudge.

12:20.920 --> 12:23.170
Thus, she is Otogiri Oiran, the Soul-Sucking Courtesan.

12:24.540 --> 12:27.540
Behold this magnificent flower,
blooming in the madness...

12:28.750 --> 12:32.080
Behold her butterflies,
glimmering in the night amongst its petals...

12:32.710 --> 12:36.080
Whom is the fairest of them all, you ask?

12:36.540 --> 12:39.130
Well, look upon me.

12:42.580 --> 12:44.080
Mom.

12:46.500 --> 12:47.750
Meatballs.

13:10.580 --> 13:12.880
It transformed a section of her skin.

13:13.830 --> 13:15.040
Thanks, Keitaro.

13:16.250 --> 13:21.080
That was close, but now I've got a better idea
of what's changed about this spirit.

13:21.830 --> 13:27.380
First, it's too fast to deflect,
and too tough to even leave a scratch on it.

13:27.500 --> 13:29.960
It's using its rock-hard arms to crush anything in its path.

13:31.080 --> 13:36.250
Anything that gets crushed is turned into meatballs,
which norish it further.

13:36.960 --> 13:40.500
It's gonna be way more annoying
to deal with than before,

13:40.880 --> 13:44.290
if only because what was once two separate attacks
is now rolled into one attack.

13:44.790 --> 13:48.170
Thankfully, it's definitely doing worse now,
and its attacks aren't invisible anymore.

13:48.380 --> 13:54.080
It can only absorb things it can reach,
so we can attack it from out of its range.

13:55.290 --> 13:58.500
Long story short, watch out for the arms, guys.

13:58.630 --> 14:00.170
O-okay.

14:04.960 --> 14:05.630
Her...

14:07.880 --> 14:08.790
Her skin...

14:09.670 --> 14:11.040
She did that back at the love hotel, too...

14:21.960 --> 14:23.080
It's about to get ugly.

14:24.080 --> 14:26.920
Let's back off. Whatever you do,
do not touch those butterflies.

14:34.540 --> 14:36.380
That is the start of Otogiri Oiran's curse

14:38.080 --> 14:39.250
The first stage...

14:41.500 --> 14:43.420
<b>SOUL-SUCKING</b>

14:41.540 --> 14:42.540
...Soul-Sucking.

14:46.380 --> 14:51.250
Anyone who touches the fiery butterflies
will start aging as the life is sucked out of them.

14:52.080 --> 14:52.830
Then...

14:56.130 --> 14:56.960
She healed!

14:57.170 --> 15:01.380
That life force is used to heal her
and strengthen her curse.

15:01.920 --> 15:06.920
The more she sucks in, the more beautiful
and more powerful she becomes,

15:07.290 --> 15:09.290
and the more varied her attacks become.

15:10.540 --> 15:14.750
The stronger her opponent, the stronger she becomes,
the brighter her beauty shines.

15:15.790 --> 15:19.580
And the boy's toughness will do nothing
to protect him from her.

15:22.790 --> 15:26.460
You drank some of my blood, did you not?

15:28.080 --> 15:30.500
She must have enough energy now.

15:32.830 --> 15:33.380
Watch.

15:49.750 --> 15:51.960
Wh-what's happening to him?

15:52.330 --> 15:54.000
This is the second phase of her curse:

15:55.330 --> 15:56.130
Pestilence.

15:56.920 --> 16:00.210
She suffered this same sickness when she was alive.

16:00.630 --> 16:07.000
Lumps swell all over your skin, followed by
headaches, fever, nausea, and a drowsy daze...

16:08.920 --> 16:14.880
After I took her into my possession,
I had a dream where I saw her past.

16:16.290 --> 16:21.210
She was blessed with natural beauty,
so when her poor family fell on hard times,

16:21.210 --> 16:24.290
she turned her beauty into an asset
and sold her body as a courtesan.

16:24.880 --> 16:31.130
Beauty was life itself.
That truth became the creed she lived by.

16:31.790 --> 16:39.170
That is why now, she endlessly drains life from those
around her, bolstering her life-affirming beauty...

16:39.920 --> 16:41.880
with no regard or pity for those she destroys.

16:42.790 --> 16:45.130
S-so she's going to drain him to death...

16:52.960 --> 16:54.460
Is he going to pull through?

18:06.000 --> 18:08.670
It'll be over for us if he crushes her whole body.

18:09.500 --> 18:13.920
Is he throwing a temper tantrum,
or is he hurting her for fun?

18:15.000 --> 18:18.290
I didn't want to have to use this, but I've got no choice...

18:20.330 --> 18:22.130
What are you doing, Yayoi-chan...?

18:22.380 --> 18:24.210
Forcing out the third phase of the curse.

18:25.290 --> 18:28.080
I had to wait for her to suck out enough power,

18:28.210 --> 18:30.420
and I needed conditions to be right.

18:30.790 --> 18:32.000
What do you mean?

18:32.380 --> 18:33.080
Just watch.

18:34.830 --> 18:40.710
I'll use her old mirror...
to show her just how ugly she's become.

18:41.830 --> 18:45.040
It's something I only want to use
when things literally get ugly.

19:01.080 --> 19:02.500
Otogiri Oiran?

19:03.170 --> 19:09.960
This is Kurenai. She will be your new apprentice.
Do take care of her, now.

19:12.290 --> 19:17.000
I promise to work hard to become
a courtesan as lovely as you are!

19:17.830 --> 19:21.670
Please, would you honor me with your tutelage?

19:24.630 --> 19:25.540
Very well.

19:25.710 --> 19:27.000
Th-thank you!

19:28.250 --> 19:29.290
Is this for me?

19:29.290 --> 19:32.040
Let your beauty wither, and your life is over.

19:32.670 --> 19:36.710
You must always strive to be your best,
most beautiful self. Understood?

19:37.170 --> 19:38.040
Yes, ma'am!

19:38.790 --> 19:41.080
I will treasure this gift and heed your words!

19:43.040 --> 19:43.790
Otogiri...

19:44.830 --> 19:47.080
I would like to purchase your freedom.

19:48.750 --> 19:52.330
I want your beauty by my side, now and forever.

19:52.710 --> 19:54.130
My darling Ito...

19:57.380 --> 20:00.670
I would be happy to spend my life with you.

20:06.630 --> 20:07.540
He's been poisoned!

20:08.380 --> 20:10.170
Someone, call a doctor, quickly!

20:10.170 --> 20:11.040
Why?

20:11.040 --> 20:13.130
Let me through!

20:13.290 --> 20:14.080
We need a doctor!

20:14.080 --> 20:15.670
We need to find a doctor!

20:20.920 --> 20:23.380
I hand over my money, and this is my thanks?!

20:24.130 --> 20:26.290
That poison almost killed me!

20:26.880 --> 20:29.170
How dare you mock my kindness, whore!

20:29.330 --> 20:32.130
N-no, please, it wasn't-

20:32.130 --> 20:33.080
Quiet!

20:34.420 --> 20:37.880
I don't want to hear another word from your foul lips!

20:43.330 --> 20:50.670
Please, I must be healed...
I must be beautiful for him to hear the truth.

20:51.080 --> 20:55.080
For him to understand. For him to take me in.

20:55.750 --> 21:00.630
I must be beautiful, before my money
and medicine are gone...

21:02.580 --> 21:03.880
Away with you, hag!

21:10.170 --> 21:12.580
Please... I need money.

21:12.960 --> 21:14.920
Just a bit of money, and I'll...

21:14.920 --> 21:15.880
Why, hello.

21:17.880 --> 21:19.670
Kurenai?

21:24.920 --> 21:27.290
Your man was gracious enough to buy my freedom.

21:30.420 --> 21:31.500
No...

21:33.040 --> 21:36.580
Since I won't be seeing you again,
why don't I tell you the whole story?

21:37.500 --> 21:41.460
I have always been the most
beautiful woman in the house.

21:42.290 --> 21:49.880
More beautiful than you,
yet you were wrongfully seated above me.

21:50.630 --> 21:52.210
It was humiliating.

21:53.290 --> 21:56.290
I could not let it stand.
I would not let you shame me any further.

21:57.080 --> 22:01.830
So, I poisoned him. It was me.

22:03.170 --> 22:06.250
Remember this trinket?

22:07.170 --> 22:09.130
I'm so glad I came to see you.

22:09.420 --> 22:11.380
Nothing could make me happier...

22:12.170 --> 22:17.000
...than seeing how disgusting you've become!

22:29.290 --> 22:31.040
Kurenai...

22:37.540 --> 22:40.130
What is this foul smell? Oil?!

22:40.130 --> 22:42.790
You will pay.

22:46.420 --> 22:51.250
You will burn in the fires of my rage!

23:07.750 --> 23:09.000
The third stage of the curse:

23:09.880 --> 23:11.750
The white-hot flames of resentment,

23:12.710 --> 23:15.330
fueled by her very life...

23:16.920 --> 23:18.170
The Burning Manse.

23:17.460 --> 23:21.040
<b>THE BURNING MANSE</b>

23:22.460 --> 23:27.580
A child's rage meets the anger of a woman scorned.

23:28.670 --> 23:32.460
Pitch black and rouge red resentment clash.

23:33.880 --> 23:38.630
When the dust clears, will they find salvation or ruin?
